# A2A Consumer Banking System - Codebase Analysis
## Comprehensive Technical Overview

---

## Slide 1: Project Overview
**Title: A2A Consumer Banking System**

**What it is:**
- Agent-to-Agent (A2A) automated corporate credit line processing system
- AI-powered financial network using Google's Agent Development Kit (ADK)
- Simulates multiple competing banks processing credit applications
- ESG-integrated lending with sustainability-focused interest rate adjustments

**Key Innovation:**
- Automated corporate credit applications across multiple financial institutions
- Real-time ESG evaluation and carbon footprint assessment
- Wells Fargo Agent Protocol (WFAP) for secure inter-agent communication

---

## Slide 2: System Architecture
**Title: Distributed Microservices Architecture**

**Core Components:**
1. **Consumer Agent (Host)** - Port 8000
   - Web-based interface for credit applications
   - Coordinates with multiple bank agents
   - Loan offer comparison and negotiation

2. **Bank Agents (5 Banks)** - Ports 10002-10006
   - CloudTrust Financial (Conservative, ESG-focused)
   - Finovate Bank (Competitive lending)
   - Zentra Bank (Specialized solutions)
   - NexVault Bank (Digital-first)
   - Byte Bank (Technology-focused)

**Communication Protocol:**
- Wells Fargo Agent Protocol (WFAP) for structured messaging
- JSON-RPC for agent-to-agent communication
- Digital signatures for security

---

## Slide 3: Technology Stack
**Title: Modern AI & Financial Technology Stack**

**Core Technologies:**
- **Python 3.8+** - Primary language
- **Google ADK** - AI agent framework
- **A2A SDK** - Agent communication protocol
- **Flask** - Web framework
- **Starlette/Uvicorn** - ASGI server

**AI & ML:**
- **Google Generative AI** (Gemini 2.5 Flash)
- **Tachyon ADK Client** - AI model integration

**Data & Security:**
- **Pydantic** - Data validation
- **JSONSchema** - API validation
- **PyJWT** - Token security
- **Cryptography** - Digital signatures

---

## Slide 4: Credit Processing Workflow
**Title: Automated Loan Processing Pipeline**

**Step-by-Step Process:**
1. **Initial Risk Assessment**
   - Financial health analysis (revenue, assets, liabilities)
   - Industry risk classification
   - Geographic compliance verification
   - Basic eligibility screening

2. **ESG Evaluation**
   - Carbon emissions analysis (70% weight)
   - ESG certifications validation (30% weight)
   - Industry benchmarking
   - Sustainability scoring

3. **Interest Rate Calculation**
   - Base rate + Risk premium - ESG discount
   - Dynamic lending ratio calculations
   - Weighted risk score methodology

4. **Loan Offer Generation**
   - Approved amount determination
   - Repayment duration calculation
   - Terms and conditions compilation
   - Digital signature application

---

## Slide 5: ESG Integration Framework
**Title: Comprehensive ESG Scoring & Interest Rate Discounts**

**ESG Scoring Components:**
- **Carbon Performance (70%):** Industry-adjusted emissions intensity
- **Qualitative Factors (30%):** Certifications, governance, reporting

**Interest Rate Discounts:**
- **ESG Leader (≥90 score):** 0.75% discount
- **Strong Performer (≥75):** 0.50% discount  
- **Average Performer (≥50):** 0.25% discount
- **Laggard (<50):** 0.00% discount

**Supported Certifications:**
- B-Corp, ISO 14001, SBTI, Carbon Neutral, LEED, Fair Trade

**Innovation:** Real-time ESG report fetching from company URLs

---

