## Slide 7: File Structure & Components
**Title: Codebase Organization**

**Main Directories:**
```
├── code/src/
│   ├── bank_agent_1-5_adk/     # 5 Individual bank agents
│   │   ├── agent.py            # Agent configuration & workflow
│   │   ├── bank_policy_tools.py # Risk assessment & loan tools
│   │   ├── main.py             # Server entry point
│   │   └── wfap_protocol.py    # WFAP implementation
│   ├── host_agent_adk/         # Consumer agent
│   │   ├── agent.py            # Host agent logic
│   │   ├── web_server.py       # Flask web interface
│   │   ├── host_tools.py       # Credit request tools
│   │   └── index.html          # Web UI
│   └── requirements.txt        # Dependencies
├── test/                       # Test configurations
├── artifacts/arch/schema.json  # WFAP protocol schema
└── Documentation files
```

**Key Components:**
- **25+ Python files** with ~8,000+ lines of code
- **Modular architecture** with clear separation of concerns
- **Comprehensive test suite** with sample company configurations

