## Slide 8: Business Logic Deep Dive
**Title: Core Banking Policy Implementation**

**Risk Assessment Engine:**
- **Financial Health Metrics:** Profitability ratios, leverage analysis
- **Industry Risk Classifications:** NAICS-based risk scoring
- **Weighted Score Calculation:** Multi-factor risk aggregation
- **Approval Thresholds:** Bank-specific lending criteria

**Interest Rate Composition:**
```
Final Rate = Base Rate + Risk Premium - ESG Discount
```

**Lending Ratio Logic:**
- High-quality borrowers: Up to 90% of requested amount
- Medium-risk: 70-85% approval ratio
- High-risk: 50-70% with higher interest rates

**Automated Decision Making:**
- Pass/Fail initial screening
- Dynamic amount approval based on risk
- Automated rejection with detailed explanations

---

## Slide 9: Web Interface & User Experience
**Title: Modern Web-Based Banking Interface**

**Frontend Features:**
- **Responsive Design:** HTML/CSS/JavaScript interface
- **Real-time Updates:** Server-sent events for live loan processing
- **Interactive Forms:** Comprehensive credit application workflow
- **Offer Comparison:** Side-by-side bank offer analysis

**Backend API:**
- **RESTful Endpoints:** `/api/chat`, `/api/sessions`, `/api/health`
- **Streaming Responses:** Real-time agent communication
- **Session Management:** Multi-user session handling
- **Error Handling:** Comprehensive error management

**User Journey:**
1. Submit credit application with company details
2. Real-time processing across all bank agents
3. Receive and compare multiple loan offers
4. Negotiate terms with specific banks
5. Select and accept best offer

