## Slide 12: Deployment & Operations
**Title: System Deployment Architecture**

**Server Configuration:**
- **Consumer Agent:** Port 8000 (Web interface)
- **Bank Agents:** Ports 10002-10006 (Individual banks)
- **Concurrent Processing:** Multi-threaded request handling
- **Async Operations:** Non-blocking I/O for scalability

**Startup Scripts:**
- `start_banking_system.bat` - Launch all bank agents
- `start_adk_web_server.bat` - Start consumer web interface
- Automated initialization and health checking

**Monitoring & Logging:**
- **Comprehensive Logging:** Request/response tracking
- **Health Endpoints:** System status monitoring
- **Error Handling:** Graceful failure management
- **Session Tracking:** Multi-user session management

